+---
+name: hive-status
+description: Summarize tasks across every registered hive project.
+---
+
+Run `hive status --json` and report, for each project, the tasks that are
+waiting for human input (`action_key` is `needs_input` or `review_findings`)
+and any tasks in a red recovery state.
+
+- Parse the typed envelope (schema `hive-status`), do not scrape prose.
+- Present a compact table: project, slug, stage, action, age.
+- If `hive` is not installed, stop and tell the user to install it (see
+  INSTALL.md), then retry.
